---
import FormationGraphic from './FormationGraphic.astro';
---

<section class="architectural-grid section-y border-b border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-primary)]">
  <div class="editorial-container">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[7fr_5fr] lg:gap-16">
      <div>
        <div class="mb-8">
          <span class="eyebrow-pill">
            <span class="inline-block size-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--accent-signal)]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            THE VISIBLE AGENT • ORIENTATION IN CHAOS
          </span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="h1 mb-7 max-w-[14.5ch] text-[var(--text-primary)]">
          Everything is moving faster. But who has <em>wise hands at the wheel?</em>
        </h1>

        <div class="mb-8 border-l-2 border-[var(--accent-signal)] pl-5 sm:pl-6">
          <p class="editorial-quote">
            <strong class="font-normal text-[var(--accent-signal)]">Find formation.</strong> Better decisions in a world of accelerating possibilities.
          </p>
        </div>

        <p class="p-body measure-prose mb-10">
          We have never had more capability. But capability without direction creates confusion. We help capable people cut through organisational noise, coordinate human judgement, and move together with conviction.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:gap-7">
          <a
            href="#book"
            data-btn-hover
            class="btn-huge rounded-full"
          >
            <span aria-hidden="true" class="btn__circle-wrap">
              <span class="btn__circle">
                <span class="before__100"></span>
              </span>
            </span>
            <span>Let’s talk.</span>
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M13.125 10.7493H4.74958C4.53722 10.7493 4.35917 10.6779 4.21542 10.535C4.07181 10.3921 4 10.215 4 10.0037C4 9.79247 4.07181 9.61393 4.21542 9.4681C4.35917 9.32227 4.53722 9.24935 4.74958 9.24935H13.125L9.45396 5.57831C9.3041 5.42845 9.22917 5.25282 9.22917 5.05143C9.22917 4.85004 9.30556 4.66963 9.45833 4.51018C9.61111 4.36407 9.78819 4.29102 9.98958 4.29102C10.191 4.29102 10.3667 4.36615 10.5169 4.51643L15.4708 9.47664C15.5458 9.55178 15.6007 9.63317 15.6354 9.72081C15.6701 9.80845 15.6875 9.9024 15.6875 10.0027C15.6875 10.1028 15.6701 10.1968 15.6354 10.2846C15.6007 10.3722 15.5486 10.4507 15.4792 10.5202L10.5208 15.4785C10.3681 15.6313 10.1944 15.7042 10 15.6973C9.80556 15.6903 9.63194 15.6138 9.47917 15.4677C9.32639 15.3082 9.25 15.1266 9.25 14.9229C9.25 14.7193 9.32639 14.5434 9.47917 14.3952L13.125 10.7493Z" fill="currentColor"></path>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a
            class="group text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] underline decoration-[var(--accent-signal)] underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-[var(--accent-signal)]"
            href="/about"
          >
            Read the 5-Part Narrative <span class="inline-block transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <FormationGraphic variant="hero" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 grid gap-px border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--border-subtle)] sm:mt-20 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="bg-[var(--bg-elevated)] p-6 sm:p-7">
        <p class="technical-label mb-2 text-[var(--accent-signal)]">01 / ORIENTATION</p>
        <p class="h4 mb-1.5 text-[var(--text-primary)]">Visibility creates orientation.</p>
        <p class="p-card">A clear, unmistakable point of reference when signals get crossed and noise masquerades as urgency.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-[var(--bg-elevated)] p-6 sm:p-7">
        <p class="technical-label mb-2 text-[var(--accent-signal)]">02 / COORDINATION</p>
        <p class="h4 mb-1.5 text-[var(--text-primary)]">Wise hands at the wheel.</p>
        <p class="p-card">Calm, seasoned practitioner judgement rooted in human behaviour—not abstract theory or algorithmic hype.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-[var(--bg-elevated)] p-6 sm:p-7">
        <p class="technical-label mb-2 text-[var(--accent-signal)]">03 / INDEPENDENCE</p>
        <p class="h4 mb-1.5 text-[var(--text-primary)]">Useful, never indispensable.</p>
        <p class="p-card">Steady hands when it matters. Once your team has formation and conviction, we step aside.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>